---
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import companion from '../assets/screenshots/companion-app.png';
---
<section id="companion" class="chapter chapter-surface"><div class="container companion-layout"><div class="companion-copy"><h2>Your Mac,<br />on the bar</h2><p class="section-intro">ScryBar Companion lives in the menu bar. It sends Now Playing, Mac Stats and Bambu print information over your LAN.</p><a href="https://github.com/enuzzo/scrybar/releases/download/companion-v0.3.15/ScryBarCompanion-0.3.15.dmg" class="button">Download for Mac</a><p class="download-note">Companion v0.3.15 (53) · macOS 14+<br />Preview release · signed ad hoc, not notarized</p><div class="disclosures"><details><summary>First launch on macOS</summary><p>Open the DMG and drag ScryBarCompanion.app to Applications. The current preview release is signed ad hoc and not notarized. macOS may ask you to allow it in System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security.</p><a href="https://github.com/enuzzo/scrybar/tree/main/companion/mac/ScryBarCompanion#readme">Installation instructions</a></details><details><summary>Album artwork</summary><p>The current player’s own cover comes first, with source, track and album checked together. ScryBar uses 150 px artwork. Meguru receives optional 512 px artwork only when a genuine high-resolution source matches the current cover. Smaller images are not enlarged into HD.</p></details><details><summary>CPU and GPU temperatures</summary><p>On supported Apple Silicon Macs, temperature readings use the optional <a href="https://github.com/vladkens/macmon">macmon</a> helper. Unavailable readings appear as a dash.</p><pre><code>brew install macmon</code></pre></details><details><summary>Bambu camera</summary><p>Add an A1/P1 printer in Companion. Open Camera on your Mac or tap CAM on ScryBar. Keep Companion running while using the camera.</p><a href="https://github.com/enuzzo/scrybar/blob/main/companion/mac/ScryBarCompanion/README.md#bambu-camera">Camera setup</a></details></div></div><figure class="companion-figure"><Image src={companion} alt="ScryBar Companion menu bar popover with Now Playing and Mac Stats" width={345} height={377} loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Companion interface capture</figcaption></figure></div></section>
